    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i can even do that. talking to a doctors feels like just another thing on the list... another thing i have to do, another thing i have to manage. i'm just so done with managing. i just want everything to be quiet. i want the noise and the pressure and the constant \"doing\" to just... stop. permanently.",
