      "content": "\"letting go of the effort\"... that sounds so peaceful. but i'm scared that if i stop fighting, i'll just fail even harder at everything. everyone depends on me to keep going. but what if the only way to actually get that stillness you mean is to just... not be here anymore? like, to actually be at rest?",
